## Why This Is Asked
The question probes PCA deployment under strict latency on edge devices with drift and missing data in a new domain.

## Key Concepts
- PCA, imputation, scaling, explained variance, latency-aware inference, global vs per-city models, loadings interpretation.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: edge PCA inference
function project(x, mean, scale, components){
  const z = x.map((v,i)=> (v-mean[i])/scale[i]);
  return dot(z, components);
}
```

